<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.3 points to 895 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 8.3 points to 895 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.3 points on Thursday to 895, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the machinery index losing most, down 16.3 points to 1,166.3.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
